SUMMARY:Bhāvikā | Transcending Language
DESCRIPTION:\nThree profound stories. Three powerful languages.\n\n\nThis Odissi performance weaves together multilingual narratives through storytelling\, dance\, and music\, celebrating the universality of the human experience. Transcending origins\, the evening is a testament to artistic expression being a language unto itself. When words cease\, expression expands. \nCredits:\nPerformance: Shashwati Garai Ghosh\n\nLight Design: Amlan Chaudhari \n\nThis is the eleventh edition of the ‘All For Dance’ series presented by Kalavaahini in association with BIC\, curated by Malavika Sarukkai. The ‘All For Dance’ series is presented every quarter at BIC to spotlight some of the best classical dance from across India. The series is managed by Shreya Nagarajan Singh Arts Development Consultancy. \n\nIn collaboration with: \n \n\n\nAn Odissi Recital\nRSVPs will open on Nov 13 at 6pm.\n*Performer*: Shashwati Garai Ghosh\n*Event Categories*: Culture\, Dance\, Performing Arts
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/bhavika-transcending-language/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Culture,Dance,Performing Arts
