SUMMARY:Jahnavi
DESCRIPTION:Gentle\, graceful\, and full of force\, the Ganga calls you to her banks. \nThis Bharatanatyam performance follows the river Ganga from Gangotri to Varanasi\, bringing her changing moods to life through choreography\, music\, and visual design. What does it mean to travel a river as a pilgrim does\, one verse at a time? \nThe performance evolved from the choreographer’s work on the official anthem for Namami Gange\, the Government of India’s mission to rejuvenate the Ganga. Set predominantly to Sanskrit verses\, the work treats the river as a thread connecting places\, people\, and generations. \nSupported by:\n \nVenue: Auditorium\n\n\nThe Sacred River\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf0Q9h-cxh4NJsRNKxf2TXH5zlQMJ46qBNSgC2x2cVGtFMDAA/viewform?usp=pp_url)\n*Performer*: Lavanya Sankar\n*Event Categories*: Dance\, Performing Arts
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/jahnavi/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Dance,Performing Arts
